s": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["尺寸对应总像素（不然会崩）\n数值越大，总像素越高，画面理论细节越多，但不等于视频质量越好，H3 有上限坑。\n2.0（1920×1088）分辨率最高\n❌但不要直接开 2.0，对 Minimax H3 属高危档位\n分档位解读\n0.2‑0.4 mp\n低分辨率，画面模糊，细节少；适合快速预览测试。\n✅0.5‑0.7 mp【黄金稳定区间】（最推荐日常出片）\n16:9 →960×544 ~1152×640\n细节足够，闪烁少、肢体崩坏概率低，人物不容易变形。\n0.8‑1.0 mp 高像素档位\n分辨率更高，细节会多一点，但副作用明显：更容易画面闪烁、肢体崩坏、人脸漂移；\n1.2 ~2.0 mp（1920×1088）高危档位\n像素最高：H3 模型原生训练并没有大量 1080P 样本；\n开 2.0 经常出现：疯狂闪烁、肢体错乱、物体抖动，很多时候反而画质观感不如 0.6‑0.7；\n\n| 总像素 megapixels | 比例 Aspect | 尺寸 Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "视频尺寸", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [286.25714111328125, 511.1802673339844], "pos": [-651.35693359375, -366.53961181640625], "id": 51, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [56], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["9a2818f3e1a7fecde627a291683ae89c65a6755161fb0d9bcd6d436d0a9e9bf8.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [290.10211181640625, 334.3087158203125], "pos": [-651.35693359375, 94.66756439208984], "id": 37, "pr